{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-open-immersion-locally-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7a750eebc8f434a20b3344cd129876b24c47bd08fb988b512acb615215afe23f", "source_text": "Any open immersion is locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8e60863f48330dabd8715c871d4a12a92b20ba087383e00d610855036e49c087", "unit_id": "tag:01TT:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f59d12bdbc836d549fafe5d8216e1c4932cf879473d596efcb6c9157166d3f2c", "source_text": "This is true because an open immersion is a local isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:acb4ec29b81aa746a58aa6944bf2eb44b4cbbc3550be451946e31155b346a9c6", "unit_id": "tag:01TT:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-compact-open-immersion-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b8b8bbb54ac6594f0576b7bdf084879a05cf9fec8350db4013929054bc4c340e", "source_text": "Any open immersion is of finite presentation if and only if\nit is quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aee2b1a1c09d2ef6fad89be2810c63aafb8bd14c2f2777f0ddb79475c0635a7e", "unit_id": "tag:01TU:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-open-immersion-locally-finite-presentation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-immersions-monomorphisms}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{definition-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:88c0b2a68382bdcfb31463ad736cf6d7f21f6e3f7b246179edd93bfa54af3fb1", "source_text": "We have seen (Lemma <REF_0001>)\nthat an open immersion is locally of finite presentation.\nWe have seen (Schemes, Lemma <REF_0002>)\nthat an immersion is separated and hence quasi-separated. From this\nand Definition <REF_0003> the lemma follows.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e9fe3f457e200d1d2fe5ffa5f30589847288134d9cf6d47a5917b46a45d97f4e", "unit_id": "tag:01TU:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nClosed immersions of finite presentation correspond\nto quasi-coherent sheaves of ideals of finite type.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$i : Z \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{I} = \\Ker(\\mathcal{O}_X \\to i_*\\mathcal{O}_Z)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-closed-immersion-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e60c19d558116b3e8c50d619c33ec28964f63085860bf7c9776114f007efc134", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:47bbd0e123e3201fb86c9135194bc5094f1e0f59a87061183200665eaac51878", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nA closed immersion <MATH_0001> is of finite presentation if and only if\nthe associated quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals\n<MATH_0002>\nis of finite type (as an <MATH_0003>-module).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:04f9dfcd4914ce7f3a3f2fe523a8522a0121b076e6f6cd739efe8f408e857f3c", "unit_id": "tag:01TV:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Spec(R) \\subset X$", "MATH_0002": "$i^{-1}(\\Spec(R)) = \\Spec(R/I)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{I} = \\widetilde{I}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0005": "$I$", "MATH_0006": "$R$", "MATH_0007": "$R/I$", "MATH_0008": "$R$", "MATH_0009": "$I$", "MATH_0010": "$R$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-lemma-finite-type-module}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7014c36a409f4260cd7f25b1b7591101b57b81519bf667cf52825985efc0790c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ba2d13ca9ca7fec582f7d9d501c46b1032b41292f9f71b404cc3ace59bdcf5f1", "source_text": "On any affine open <MATH_0001> we have\n<MATH_0002> and\n<MATH_0003>. Moreover, <MATH_0004>\nis of finite type if and only if <MATH_0005> is a finite <MATH_0006>-module\nfor every such affine open (see\nProperties, Lemma <REF_0001>).\nAnd <MATH_0007> is of finite presentation\nover <MATH_0008> if and only if <MATH_0009> is a finite <MATH_0010>-module. Hence we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8c8adda7f81c2c159d5b4e8edaecd8f6d1703154630029bd1e174a0307274c30", "unit_id": "tag:01TV:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01TO", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-presentation-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:05450e64e0f6a244ef1955cb1888151f08f4c615d9c652b33a94c6618aa51cb2", "source_text": "A morphism which is locally of finite presentation is locally of finite type.\nA morphism of finite presentation is of finite type.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:92df17b1f929423d789954b1427ef46ce17eb80205bc17747f44a7084dc1c0e5", "unit_id": "tag:01TW:statement"}
